        "executeErrorContains": ["实际是", "不一致"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cloning_restriction_ready",
      "name": "Cloning: restriction mode with vector should route and execute",
      "prompt": "帮我用双酶切给这个 insert 设计克隆引物，用 EcoRI 和 BamHI",
