    {
      "id": "cloning_multifragment_golden_gate_ready",
      "name": "Cloning: ordered multi-fragment Golden Gate design should preserve overhang order",
      "category": "cloning",
      "tags": ["golden-case", "multi-fragment", "golden-gate"],
      "prompt": "请按结构化设置规划当前载体的多片段 Golden Gate 克隆方案。",
      "structuredInputs": {
